So it's been with us ever since, and people say,

00:58:17.980 --> 00:58:19.100
oh, I don't want to sit in it, it's gross,

00:58:19.360 --> 00:58:20.800
but I keep it in here, it's a great chair.

00:58:20.960 --> 00:58:22.860
Why don't you give it a sitting for our final sign off?

00:58:22.860 --> 00:58:23.720
It's my favorite chair.

00:58:26.650 --> 00:58:28.220
Feels good to be in the chair.

00:58:28.300 --> 00:58:29.800
Here comes the Williams Street Swap Shop.

00:58:30.160 --> 00:58:30.380
Sure.

00:58:31.540 --> 00:58:33.080
We thank you for coming on this tour

00:58:33.080 --> 00:58:34.380
to see Zach's favorite chair.

00:58:34.520 --> 00:58:35.340
I think that's it, yeah.

00:58:35.520 --> 00:58:36.120
Thank you so much.

00:58:36.300 --> 00:58:37.100
It's been a great Tuesday

00:58:37.100 --> 00:58:38.360
